From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:20:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/25] Add PRTS target registry and per-window viewport
 control

Observe browser collections, tab strips and WebContents for stable target IDs, lifecycle events and headless navigation. Retain process/profile lifetime across last-window closure and apply per-target device emulation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

